“If you don’t want to, refuse.”
What do you mean, give it up?

85
00:04:34.186 --> 00:04:36.080
- Seriously?
- But...

86
00:04:36.104 --> 00:04:39.197
the ugly girl would confess to me,
I would definitely refuse her.

87
00:04:39.221 --> 00:04:42.673
I'm flying faster into the future
