173
00:09:05.115 --> 00:09:06.214
Yes.

174
00:09:06.274 --> 00:09:08.971
Thank you for taking me to the hospital.

175
00:09:09.590 --> 00:09:13.047
My pleasure. I didn't even think
that you have lost your memory.

176
00:09:13.147 --> 00:09:15.245
