185
00:09:39.321 --> 00:09:40.575
How good!

186
00:09:40.599 --> 00:09:43.572
We'll catch him soon.

187
00:09:43.596 --> 00:09:44.775
Don't worry.

188
00:09:44.835 --> 00:09:45.934
Fine.

189
00:09:46.593 --> 00:09:52.128
By the way, you said that the suspect
dragged you into a taxi.

190
00:09:52.428 --> 00:09:56.524
