235
00:12:18.322 --> 00:12:21.579
Look at her. What does it do? Fell in love.

236
00:12:21.718 --> 00:12:24.491
Like any handsome guy
you can fall in love with yourself.

237
00:12:24.515 --> 00:12:25.934
Smart!

238
00:12:26.913 --> 00:12:28.212
Cute.

239
00:12:28.472 --> 00:12:29.730
This is cute?

240
00:12:30.270 --> 00:12:33.766
OK. Yes, that's what guys do
I really like it.

241
00:12:34.386 --> 00:12:36.919
Silent films are a type of
cinema,

242
00:12:36.943 --> 00:12:39.840
