243
00:12:39.940 --> 00:12:44.511
Directors have long dreamed of combining
picture with sound

244
00:12:44.535 --> 00:12:48.468
but due to technical difficulties
until the 20s of the XX century

245
00:12:48.492 --> 00:12:51.389
