815
00:47:19.461 --> 00:47:20.759
Song Jae...

816
00:47:21.339 --> 00:47:23.197
Coming soon. Coming soon.

817
00:47:32.208 --> 00:47:36.584
Little sister, take my homework from class
and hand it over to the professor.

818
00:47:37.163 --> 00:47:39.101
What a fool!

819
00:47:43.716 --> 00:47:44.855
Should I come here?

820
00:47:46.474 --> 00:47:48.092
Is Sun Jae flying away?

821
00:47:49.710 --> 00:47:51.524
So suddenly? Strange.

822
00:47:51.548 --> 00:47:55.001
His coach since last year
persuaded him to go to rehabilitation.

823
00:47:55.025 --> 00:47:56.679
We must meet him!

824
00:47:56.703 --> 00:47:58.278
He's flying away, idiot.

825
00:47:58.302 --> 00:48:01.119
And the plane is at six, that's in an hour.

826
00:48:01.578 --> 00:48:02.957
It's already late.

827
00:48:03.257 --> 00:48:04.516
Asshole.

828
00:48:08.611 --> 00:48:09.710
Song Jae!

829
00:48:10.450 --> 00:48:13.862
How many things do you have? I gained 30 kg.

830
00:48:13.886 --> 00:48:15.341
- What?
- Container with gochujang

831
00:48:15.365 --> 00:48:19.496
I packed it well
so be careful not to break anything.

832
00:48:19.520 --> 00:48:21.499
- And dried seaweed...
- Dad...

833
00:48:21.678 --> 00:48:22.733
I'm not moving.

834
00:48:22.757 --> 00:48:25.251
And besides, they will feed me there.

835
00:48:25.275 --> 00:48:30.370
Quiet, brat. That's when you eat,
You will remember your father and cry.

836
00:48:30.629 --> 00:48:33.922
And as soon as you land,
Call Coach Anu right away, got it?

837
00:48:33.946 --> 00:48:35.480
He'll pick you up.

838
00:48:35.504 --> 00:48:38.238
- Okay, okay.
- My God...

839
00:48:38.262 --> 00:48:39.357
Fly with me, if so!

840
00:48:39.381 --> 00:48:43.153
If it weren't for work, I would have flown.
You know it yourself.

841
00:48:43.177 --> 00:48:45.910
By the way, the meat is being delivered today,
I'm already in a hurry.

842
00:48:45.934 --> 00:48:47.548
I need to go to the cafe quickly.

843
00:48:47.572 --> 00:48:48.671
So...

844
00:48:49.011 --> 00:48:50.390
and don't be late.

845
00:48:51.289 --> 00:48:55.265
Fine. And you can do it yourself
get on a plane?

846
00:48:55.684 --> 00:48:58.781
Come here, come here, my dear.

847
00:48:59.481 --> 00:49:01.339
Dad believes you.

848
00:49:02.198 --> 00:49:03.936
- Good luck.
- Thank you.

849
00:49:04.476 --> 00:49:06.094
Just don't forget...

850
00:49:06.354 --> 00:49:07.928
Take off your shoes during inspection.

851
00:49:07.952 --> 00:49:09.251
I won't forget, dad!

852
00:49:13.107 --> 00:49:14.805
We're next.

853
00:49:16.184 --> 00:49:18.242
Why isn't Sun Jae here yet?

854
00:49:19.700 --> 00:49:20.799
Baek In Hyuk.

855
00:49:21.499 --> 00:49:22.598
Tell me...

856
00:49:25.215 --> 00:49:26.753
...the truth.

857
00:49:29.171 --> 00:49:30.270
Guys.

858
00:49:31.568 --> 00:49:33.706
Sun Jae won't come.

859
00:49:34.486 --> 00:49:35.585
- What?
- What?

860
00:49:37.483 --> 00:49:39.660
Hello! We are Eclipse!

861
00:49:41.998 --> 00:49:44.012
You have four people in your group.

862
00:49:44.036 --> 00:49:45.490
Where did one get lost?

863
00:49:45.514 --> 00:49:48.851
Exactly. Vocalist. Where is he?

864
00:49:49.870 --> 00:49:52.328
I'll bring him now. Just a minute.

865
00:49:52.428 --> 00:49:54.366
Yes. Just a minute.

866
00:49:54.545 --> 00:49:55.644
What's wrong with them?

867
00:50:04.575 --> 00:50:07.273
Hello. I'm vocalist Baek In Hyuk.

868
00:50:13.606 --> 00:50:17.818
Dear passengers, registration
on flight MH 272

869
00:50:17.842 --> 00:50:20.935
from Incheon to Los Angeles
declared open.

870
00:50:20.959 --> 00:50:23.736
Please come to the counter...

871
00:50:58.482 --> 00:51:00.500
He really flew away.

872
00:51:02.238 --> 00:51:03.377
Fine.

873
00:51:16.703 --> 00:51:18.961
I don't know much about traveling
in time.

874
00:51:19.221 --> 00:51:22.114
And it doesn't matter to me at all
What time are you from?

875
00:51:22.138 --> 00:51:26.034
And in no time where you found yourself,
Didn't you like me?

876
00:51:28.172 --> 00:51:29.670
Not for a second?

877
00:51:29.930 --> 00:51:31.029
No.

878
00:51:31.329 --> 00:51:32.428
I didn't like it.

879
00:51:32.727 --> 00:51:34.586
I'm sorry I lied.

880
00:51:35.245 --> 00:51:36.703
But, Sung Jae...

881
00:51:36.843 --> 00:51:39.620
I'd rather hurt you...

882
00:51:39.800 --> 00:51:42.697
than I will lose you forever again.

883
00:51:43.596 --> 00:51:47.093
All I can do is be cowardly
push you away.

884
00:52:04.975 --> 00:52:06.594
We're through, guys!

885
00:52:07.932 --> 00:52:10.789
Sun Jae, your song saved us!

886
00:52:10.849 --> 00:52:12.424
Listen, shall we bow to him?

887
00:52:12.448 --> 00:52:14.821
Let's! Which way is the USA?

888
00:52:14.845 --> 00:52:17.982
Don't know. Never mind!
Song Jae, thank you!

889
00:52:22.198 --> 00:52:25.335
Now you just have to stay
safe.

890
00:52:39.021 --> 00:52:41.315
Can you describe this pickup?

891
00:52:41.339 --> 00:52:44.995
We suspect the culprit
disappeared on it.

892
00:53:19.421 --> 00:53:21.998
Song Jae! Why are you here...

893
00:53:22.537 --> 00:53:25.794
-Where are you running?
- What are you doing here?

894
00:53:35.445 --> 00:53:40.300
No. No no! Don't come near!
Don't come near, I say!

895
00:54:22.637 --> 00:54:25.015
Why didn't you fly away?

896
00:54:28.032 --> 00:54:29.131
I won't fly away.

897
00:54:29.590 --> 00:54:30.689
Nowhere.

898
00:54:33.427 --> 00:54:34.965
Why?

899
00:54:35.385 --> 00:54:37.638
I had to fly!

900
00:54:37.662 --> 00:54:40.959
What will you do now?

901
00:54:42.617 --> 00:54:43.956
You like me!

902
00:54:46.853 --> 00:54:47.952
I know everything.

903
00:54:50.170 --> 00:54:52.188
Why did you push me away -

904
00:54:52.687 --> 00:54:53.786
everything...

905
00:54:55.724 --> 00:54:56.823
...I know.

906
00:55:00.599 --> 00:55:01.698
Therefore...

907
00:55:02.238 --> 00:55:04.056
I came for you.

908
00:55:29.610 --> 00:55:32.947
Don't take your anger out on me.

909
00:55:33.047 --> 00:55:34.785
Take care of your health.

910
00:55:35.005 --> 00:55:38.022
Sol asks me to protect you.

911
00:55:45.275 --> 00:55:48.052
MEET ME IN ANOTHER WORLD

912
00:55:53.107 --> 00:55:55.245
IN A TIME CAPSULE

913
00:56:11.768 --> 00:56:16.499
January 1, 2023.
At midnight. Near the Han River.

914
00:56:16.523 --> 00:56:17.622
Understood?

915
00:56:18.082 --> 00:56:19.457
Why first?

916
00:56:19.481 --> 00:56:22.338
Only then does the gift make sense.

917
00:56:30.270 --> 00:56:32.008
Time flies again.

918
00:56:32.308 --> 00:56:33.966
Here's my gift.

919
00:56:34.585 --> 00:56:38.961
Will he be able to get to you?
in the future?

920
00:56:39.421 --> 00:56:44.795
I pray that everything works out
while I am writing this letter.

921
00:56:45.295 --> 00:56:50.230
If you are reading this now,
that's what I want to say.

922
00:56:50.529 --> 00:56:53.067
Sung Jae, thank you...

923
00:56:53.806 --> 00:56:55.225
that I didn't give up.

924
00:57:16.144 --> 00:57:18.841
Time flies again.

925
00:57:19.620 --> 00:57:21.079
Why were you worried?

926
00:57:21.139 --> 00:57:22.434
I want to protect you.

927
00:57:22.458 --> 00:57:24.915
For what? Why protect me?

928
00:57:25.015 --> 00:57:26.314
Will I die?

929
00:57:39.560 --> 00:57:41.179
You want to save me.

930
00:57:46.034 --> 00:57:47.573
In 2023...

931
00:57:52.507 --> 00:57:53.846
...I'll die.

932
00:58:00.140 --> 00:58:01.239
I...

933
00:58:02.498 --> 00:58:03.597
I'll die...

934
00:58:04.935 --> 00:58:06.194
because of you?

935
00:58:08.292 --> 00:58:09.391
Saving you?

936
00:58:11.568 --> 00:58:12.667
No.

937
00:58:12.967 --> 00:58:14.501
No, it's not like that, Sung Jae.

938
00:58:14.525 --> 00:58:17.303
I... Just... I...

939
00:58:17.602 --> 00:58:18.701
I...

940
00:58:41.698 --> 00:58:43.157
If so...

941
00:58:45.415 --> 00:58:46.514
Salt...

942
00:58:49.650 --> 00:58:51.189
don't run away anymore.

943
00:58:54.605 --> 00:58:55.904
And don't hide your feelings.

944
00:59:03.756 --> 00:59:05.575
I will die saving you...

945
00:59:09.311 --> 00:59:10.490
...and okay.

946
00:59:11.988 --> 00:59:13.167
I don't care.

947
01:00:02.378 --> 01:00:05.431
THE CRIMINAL WHO ATTACKED RYU SUN JAE
HID

948
01:00:05.455 --> 01:00:11.469
PREMIERE OF THE FIFTH ALBUM ECLIPSE

949
01:00:26.394 --> 01:00:29.451
GRAB SUN JAE AND RUN

950
01:00:29.790 --> 01:00:33.447
It seems like your son's girlfriend.
Well, what can I tell you.

951
01:00:34.226 --> 01:00:36.204
I appreciate every minute.

952
01:00:36.623 --> 01:00:38.442
Don't hide your feelings.

953
01:00:38.501 --> 01:00:40.835
And don't hide yourself. Let's love.

954
01:00:40.859 --> 01:00:44.556
He drove onto the road without cameras.
Not a good sign.

955
01:00:45.255 --> 01:00:47.113
I asked you to be careful.

956
01:00:47.213 --> 01:00:51.029
Don't date Sol again.
This is my girlfriend.

957
01:00:52.088 --> 01:00:53.343
Did he confess?

958
01:00:53.367 --> 01:00:55.704
Don't push me away anymore.

959
01:00:56.244 --> 01:00:58.981
I'm ready to run after you anywhere.

960
01:00:59.161 --> 01:01:00.619
Even into the future.

961
01:01:01.239 --> 01:01:04.931
Translated and voiced by the studio
"Mobile TV"

962
01:01:04.955 --> 01:01:08.052
commissioned by the online cinema Ivy
in 2024.

